Package: com.fleetfinch.logs
Name: Finch Logs
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Records what the system, its services and its apps are doing
 A service that starts with the device and keeps detailed logs of the boot,
 the system log, processes, services, apps, resources, power and network,
 with an app to read them on the device.
Maintainer: FleetFinch
Author: FleetFinch
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 9.0)
